seq v=1 rig=screen program=claude build=2.1.0
# T1: `aterm ctl key act=approve` from a control client: the box closes by
# the client, but `passed`: only a proven author's act decides it. What the
# client's key chose on the screen (E8, `e8-ctl-enter-approves-by-ctl.seq`)
# would; this input carries no key the screen placed.
see busy
half
see prompt bash:not-read-only
expect open p1 approval par=t1 box=bash:not-read-only @500
admit ctl act=approve
accept
see busy
expect close p1 approval out=passed by=ctl
